<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">What a WopCart plan unlocks</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class="wp-block-list"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>0% WopCart platform fee</strong> on every transaction, instead of 2% on the free plan</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Your <strong>own gateway accounts</strong>: Stripe, PayPal, Authorize.net and 2Checkout, plus Apple Pay through your own Stripe account</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>Money goes from your buyer to your gateway to you, with WopCart not in the payment flow</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li>The same features as the free plugin: no extra download and no second plugin to install</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>After purchase, you receive a plan key. Paste it under <strong>WopCart → Settings → Payments → Plan key</strong> on each site. See the <a href="/docs/">getting started guide</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Plans</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>All plans are billed yearly in euros and include every feature. They differ only in the number of production domains.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

